\par\par \b \uc2 CORRECTED - CORRECTED-Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Won, sing fall on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  fear.  \b0\par\par\uc2 653 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Januar 2005\par 03:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     In \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  story headlined "Emerging Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 -Won, sing\par fall on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  fear" please read in the dateline ... Jan\par 4 ... instead of ... Dec 4 ... (correcting date).\par     By Rajat Bhattacharya\par     SINGAPORE, Jan 4 (Reuters) - The South Korean won and the\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2  Singapore dollar weakened on Tuesday on worries central banks   \par \par \uc2  may step up dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cap gains in the   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and bolster exports that are likely to slow this   \par \par \uc2  year.   \par \par \uc2  The won  weakened to 1,039.10 per dollar, declining   \par \par \uc2  for a second day. On Monday it hit 1,035 per dollar, its   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The Singapore dollar        weakened to 1.6385/95 per\par dollar from 1.6371 in late Monday trading in Asia.\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  data showed South Korea's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par reserves had risen 3.4 percent in December, indicating that the\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par authorities had stepped up attempts to halt the won's surge.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The won was Asia's best-performing \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in 2004, gaining 15\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par percent.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The data came two days after the finance ministry said it\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par would earmark for market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  a record 5 trillion won\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par from the amount raised from treasury bond sales in January.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The finance ministry appears poised to step up \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign\par   \f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 \par exchange intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," said Claudio Piron, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par at JP Morgan Chase in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Still, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's dollar-buying \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  have\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par so far slowed the won's gain rather than reverse it, he said,\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par adding that the extent of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was not\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par unprecedented.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar was weighed by speculation that the\par   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore may ease its monetary policy to\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par a neutral stance from a tightening bias as exports slow down\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par with a downturn in global demand for semiconductors.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Singapore's trade-driven economy grew at a\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par weaker-than-expected 2.4 percent annualised rate in the fourth\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The rupiah        bucked the trend of weakening Asian\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     It gained half a percent to 9,268 per dollar on an\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par expectation Indonesia may gain the most from a likely decision\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par by overseas lenders, represented by the so-called Paris Club,\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to cut the size of its foreign debt following last week's\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par tsunami disaster. The rupiah was Asia's worst performer in\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     "The prospect of Paris Club rescheduling for Indonesia\par could ease some balance of payments pressures," Piron said.\par     Almost two-thirds of the 150,000 people killed by the\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par tsunami disaster lived in the Aceh province of western\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indonesia.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Taiwan dollar , Asia's second-best performing\par   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  last year, gained for a second day to 31.82 per\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , supported by a strong domestic economy and\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par rising interest rates, may outperform Asian rivals in 2005 as\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the U.S. current account deficit extends the dollar's decline\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par against Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  for the fourth straight year, analysts\par   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR Change on the day at   0136 GMT\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       102.71         102.71       +0.00\par  Sing dlr        1.6388      