\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Supported by China speculation.  \b0\par\par\uc2 700 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Dezember 2004\par 04:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     SINGAPORE, Dec 22 (Reuters) - Speculative bidding up of the\par offshore yuan underpinned Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Wednesday as\par markets braced for any surprise move by China to free up the\par tightly managed \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  over the end of the year.\par     However, a lacklustre yen and thinning year-end trade\par pinned the market in tight ranges. The Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par has stayed in a one yen range around 104.25 per dollar since\par Monday, providing little direction to the Asian regionals.\par     Despite the very low volumes, the premium on the yuan in\par the non-deliverable forwards (NDF)  has risen this\par week as traders position themselves for a possible change in\par the yuan's virtually fixed rate around 8.28 per dollar.\par     One-year NDFs were quoted at 4,800 points, a level last\par seen in October 2003, which prices in a 6.2 percent\par appreciation in the yuan in a year. Near-term yuan premiums\par were also higher.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Analysts at IDEAglobal.com said the one-year premium could\par move to 5,000 points soon.\par     "But what this does though is to open the market to a risk\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of a large move to the right (a shrinking of the yuan premium),\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par if the Chinese authorities remain idle over the holidays as we\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Meanwhile, the Indonesian rupiah        showed almost no\par reaction to a ratings upgrade by Standard & Poor's.\par     S&P lifted the country's foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rating by a notch\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to B-plus, citing progress in macroeconomic stability and\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fiscal management as well as declining debt and favourable\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par external liquidity.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The rupiah was steady around 9,325 a dollar, maintaining\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par its weak bias as markets priced in security and political\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fears.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indonesian Vice-President Jusuf Kalla's weekend victory in\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the contest to lead Golkar, the biggest opposition party, is\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par widely seen as a positive for President Susilo Bambang\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Yudhoyono's political standing.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Yet some analysts are concerned Kalla's larger backing\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par could be a threat in the event of disagreements over policy in\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indonesia's fragmented cabinet.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The rupiah has also been hurt by security alerts. This\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par week, an old grenade was found in the compound of the Hilton\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par hotel in Jakarta, just days after warnings that militants might\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par attack one of the country's three Hilton hotels.\par   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 INTERVENTION\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  FEARS\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Elsewhere, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar  straddled 1.64 per\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar, although analysts said it remained in the weaker half\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of the undisclosed trade-weighed band within which the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary\par   \f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 \par Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore guides the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par There was talk that the MAS had been checking Sing dollar\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par levels with the market this week and may even have \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to rein in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Analysts at IDEAglobal said any such \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  might be\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to head off excessive Sing dollar buying, as a proxy bet on a\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Chinese revaluation, in thin market conditions.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Wariness over \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  also capped the Taiwan dollar\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  , forcing it to retreat from a 2-week high of 32.22 a\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar even as the stock market  extended its rally\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par since the start of the month.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Expectations of heavier inflow of dollars from Filipinos\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par working overseas propped up the Philippine peso , despite\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the threat of a sovereign ratings downgrade as lawmakers\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par struggle to rein in a bulging budget deficit.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  Change on the day at   0253 GMT\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       104.26         104.12       -0.13\par  Sing dlr        1.6404         1.6416       +0.07\par  Taiwan dlr      32.293         32.332       +0.12\par  Korean won     1056.60        1055.40       -0.11\par  Baht             39.04          39.02       -0.05\par  Peso             56.09          56.09       -0.01\par  Rupiah         9322.00        9315.00       -0.08\par  Rupee            43.79          43.79       +0.00\par  Change on year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid  End prev year    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       104.26         107.31       +2.93\par  Sing dlr        1.6404         1.6978       +3.50\par  Taiwan dlr      32.293         33.978       +5.22\par  Korean won     1056.60        1192.00      +12.81\par  Baht             39.04          39.59       +1.40\par  Peso             56.09          55.49       -1.08\par  Rupiah         9322.00        8410.00       -9.78\par  Rupee            43.79          45.60       +4.12.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041222e0cm003ed\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
