\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Rupiah, won down on yen, c.bank fears.  \b0\par\par\uc2 701 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Dezember 2004\par 04:25\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     SINGAPORE, Dec 8 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah hit a\par two-month trough and the Korean won tripped more than half a\par percent on Wednesday as the fear of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par and the decline in the Japanese yen undermined Asian\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par  \par     The U.S. dollar was above record euro lows and 12-year lows\par against sterling hit on Tuesday.\par     After falling steeply for two months, the U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 been supported this week by increasing rhetoric from European  \f28 \par \par \uc2 and Japanese officials worried about the rise in their  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The dollar was up around 103 yen on Wednesday after  \par \par \uc2 Japanese GDP data showed the economy barely expanded in the  \par \par \uc2 third quarter.  \par \par \uc2 The Singapore dollar weakened to around S$1.64, down 0.7  \par \par \uc2 percent from last week's six-year high. South Korea's won was  \par \par \uc2 down some 11 won from seven-year highs struck on Monday.  \par \par \uc2 "It is pretty clear that not just Korea but most Asian  \par \par \uc2 central banks are \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  quite strongly at the moment,"  \par \par \uc2 said Simon Flint, strategist with Bank of America in Singapore.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     "They would have been alarmed at the speed and extent of\par the move we have seen of late," he said.\par     The won has risen nearly seven percent since November. The\par Taiwan dollar is up four percent in that period and the Thai\par baht nearly 5 percent.\par     Reserves data showed more than $10 billion of the $14\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 billion increase in Korea's November reserves could have  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 resulted from dollar-buying \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to curb the won's  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 strength.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Analysts said around $3 billion of a $4.3 billion increase  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 in Singapore's November reserves could not be explained by  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 simply valuation effects. The reserves totalled $110.1 billion.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     "This is one of the largest implied \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  numbers we\par have seen in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," Flint said.\par     Analysts also said this week's retreat in the yen had\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 provided the region's central banks an opportunity to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 effectively, buying dollars at a time when their \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 were not being bought aggressively by the market.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 RUPIAH BLUES  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Traders said the rupiah's fall to a two month low of 9,140  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 per dollar followed dollar-buying by oil companies and other  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 importers.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Still, the rupiah has been among the region's worst  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 performers this year, bucking the rally of the past few months  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 and shedding about 8 percent so far in 2004.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A prolonged national and presidential election process  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 robbed it of some of last year's popularity as a high-yielder  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 and President Susilo Bambang Yudhoyono's fragmented cabinet has  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 raised worries about economic reforms.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The rupiah is really not seen as part of the whole Asian  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 revaluation story. The rupiah is not particularly undervalued  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 in real effective exchange rate terms," Flint said, referring  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's inflation and trade-weighted value.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The market thinks of the Asian revaluation story as a  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 correction of the U.S. current account deficit, so those  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 countries with large current account surpluses should benefit  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the most.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     "Indonesia barely has a current account surplus anymore,"\par Flint said.\par     Indonesia said on Tuesday it sold 20 percent of its seventh\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 largest bank, PT Bank Permata Tbk., for about $128 million. The  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 news of the inflow did not help the rupiah.  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Change on the day at 0248 GMT   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       103.00         102.59       -0.40\par  Sing dlr        1.6399         1.6343       -0.34\par  Taiwan dlr      32.131         32.100       -0.10\par  Korean won     1048.90        1041.80       -0.68\par  Baht             39.17          39.16       -0.03\par  Peso             55.98          56.02       +0.07\par  Rupiah         9130.00        9080.00       -0.55\par  Change on year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid  End prev year    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       