\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Juggling  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  risks, weak dollar.  \b0\par\par\uc2 813 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Dezember 2004\par 09:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Dec 7 (Reuters) - Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  ended local\par market trading on Tuesday slightly weaker but off lows,\par balancing the risks of regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and\par the renewed U.S. dollar downtrend.\par     The U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  hit fresh lows against the euro as\par markets overcame early fears of European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . The head\par of the European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and euro zone finance ministers\par said in a joint statement on Monday they were unhappy with the\par euro's surge and they were closely monitoring exchange rate\par swings.\par     But in Asia, the dollar was about a yen off five-year lows\par against the Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . It rallied from seven-year lows\par against the South Korean won on suspicion the Korean\par authorities had \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The dollar rallied over 6 won from Monday's seven-year low\par near 1,037 against the South Korean unit. But the won closed\par local trade slightly higher and was a shade stronger against\par the yen.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Taiwan dollar retreated further from last week's\par four-year high of 31.96, ending local trade on the weaker side\par of 32. Thailand's markets opened after a holiday and pushed the\par baht down after thin offshore trading had taken it past 39 per\par dollar to a February high on Monday.\par     Bhanu Baweja, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist with UBS in Singapore,\par said the stepped-up rhetoric from the Japanese and the\par Europeans had given markets an excuse to book profits on their\par extended dollar-bearish positions. Yet, he did not expect the\par European authorities to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to rein in the euro.\par  \par     "We seem to be entering a consolidation phase," Baweja\par said.\par     That would also give Asian central banks some breathing\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 space although they would \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if the pace of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 gains continued to be as rapid as it has been in the past two  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 months, he said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Elsewhere, the Indonesian rupiah weakened to around 9,090  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 from Monday's 9,060 a dollar. It has lagged the rally in the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 region, weighed down by worries over how new President Susilo  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Bambang Yudhoyono's fragmented cabinet will approve key  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 reforms.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 It has not reacted to news that the country would sell  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 another 20 percent of its seventh largest bank, PT Bank Permata  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Tbk., this week. That stake is estimated to be worth $120  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 million.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Philippine peso stayed on the weaker side of 56 per  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 dollar even after Fitch Ratings merely lowered its outlook on  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Philippines debt to negative, after fears there would be a  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 downgrade.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The rupiah and peso prove that it is not just a dollar  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 call, and the balance of payments does matter," Baweja said,  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 explaining that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in Asia with the strongest  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 external accounts were rallying the most.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SING DOLLAR STRENGTH  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Singapore dollar initially weakened to near 1.64, over  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 a cent lower than last week's six-year peak, before settling  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 around 1.6350.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Jimmy Koh, head of research at United Overseas Bank said  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the Sing was about half a percent stronger than the mid-point  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 of the undisclosed trade-weighed band within which the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary  \f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore guides the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "This means we could see the Sing stretching towards  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1.6320. However, with the key Chinese meeting out of the way,  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 it does not look like dollar/Sing will move out of its current  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 range anytime soon," Koh said in a note.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Koh was referring to China's annual closed door economic  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 summit on the weekend, where top officials pledged to keep  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 monetary and fiscal policies stable in 2005 but made no  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 explicit reference to the possibility of a yuan revaluation.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 On Tuesday, China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governor Zhou Xiaochuan  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 was quoted as saying upside risks to inflation remained and  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 monetary policy would be fine-tuned next year using  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 market-oriented measures.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Some analysts interpret that as a signal rates will rise  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 and the yuan policy will be reformed.  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  Change on the day at   0822 GMT\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       102.59         102.32       -0.26\par  Sing dlr        1.6343         1.6347       +0.02\par  Taiwan dlr      32.100         32.070       -0.09\par  Korean won     1041.80        1040.80       -0.10\par  Baht             39.16          39.22       +0.17\par  Peso             56.02          56.02       +0.00\par  Rupiah         9080.00        9060.00       -0.22\par  Rupee            43.69          43.60       -0.21\par  Change on year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid  End prev year    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       102.59         107.31       +4.60\par  Sing dlr        1.6343         1.6978       +3.89\par  Taiwan dlr      32.100         33.978       +5.85\par  Korean won     1041.80        1192.00      +14.42\par  Baht             39.16          39.59       +1.10\par  Peso             56.02          55.49       -0.95\par  Rupiah         9080.00        8410.00       -7.38\par  Rupee            43.69          45.60       +4.36.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041207e0c7006si\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
