\par\par \b \uc2 Singapore Dlr Up Late, Though Rumored MAS Action Caps  \b0\par\par\uc2 537 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Dezember 2004\par 08:16\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar was higher against its U.S. counterpart late Thursday on speculative buying, but gains were capped by rumored \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  government bonds were relatively stable in thin trading, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 At 0638 GMT, the U.S. unit was at S$1.6321, down from S$1.6348 in Asia late Wednesday. It traded between S$1.6300 and S$1.6333 intraday.  \par \par \uc2 Despite a batch of positive U.S. economic data Wednesday, the U.S. dollar maintained its downtrend against the Singapore \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , falling to a fresh six-year low of S$1.6293 in New York.  \par \par \uc2 U.S. October personal income and consumer spending data were slightly better than expected, while the Institute for Supply Management said U.S. manufacturing activity expanded at a quicker pace in November.  \par \par \uc2 Players are still fretting about the U.S. current account and fiscal deficits, traders said.  \par \par \uc2 Early in Asia Thursday, non-Singapore speculators sold the U.S. dollar down to around the psychologically important S$1.6300 level from the open of S$1.6310.  \par \par \uc2 Then, rumored \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  around there spooked the speculators into buying back the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , giving the U.S. dollar a boost to as high as S$1.6333, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 "(MAS) came in a bit and scared the market," said a local dealer.  \par \par \uc2 For the rest of the session, the U.S. dollar consolidated in the low-S$1.6300s, underpinned by talk that the MAS still had bids placed around the S$1.6300 level, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 From a technical analysis perspective, the U.S. dollar's fall against the Singapore dollar appears to be stronger than expected, as support at S$1.6350 was breached, said United Overseas Bank in a research report.  \par \par \uc2 "Downward momentum is picking up again and a clear move below S$1.6300 will likely lead to acceleration lower towards the next support at S$1.6220," said UOB.  \par \par \uc2 UOB added that it lowered its trailing stop to S$1.6430, and that only a rebound above this level would imply the market had seen a temporary low. [ 02-12-04 0716GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Singapore government bonds were relatively steady Thursday after a mixed performance by U.S. Treasurys in New York.  \par \par \uc2 The yield on the two-year bond fell one basis point to 1.54%, while that on the 10-year paper was unchanged at 2.89%.  \par \par \uc2 Interest rate swaps were also mixed from Wednesday. Late in the session, the two-year swap offer was unchanged at 1.71%, while the 10-year offer was down three basis points to 3.06%.  \par \par \uc2 The spread between two- and 10-year swaps narrowed to 135 basis points from 138 basis points the day before.  \par \par \uc2 Some prices quoted are pre-settlement bids obtained from dealers and are subject to change.  \par \par \uc2 Historical bond yields and prices can be viewed at the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore's bond Web site:  \par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.sgs.gov.sg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.sgs.gov.sg}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Singapore bureau; Dow Jones Newswires; 65-6415-4150; djnews.singapore.bureau@dowjones.com  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Edited by Ryan Woo [ 02-12-04 0837GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 1163 1859  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020041202e0c20007c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
