\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Capped by  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  worries.  \b0\par\par\uc2 602 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Oktober 2004\par 11:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Oct 26 (Reuters) - Worries about \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  capped gains in the Japanese yen and some Asian\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Tuesday despite continuing U.S. dollar weakness.\par     The dollar hit fresh lows against the euro        and other\par European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and the Australian dollar . But it\par bounced off Monday's six-month low against the yen .\par     In Asia, the Korean won                   met with\par resistance near Monday's four-year high of 1,133 a dollar. The\par Sing dollar  went within striking distance of 1.66 a\par dollar to levels last seen in April and near five-year highs.\par  \par     The Thai baht        was flat near 41 a dollar. Spikes\par above that level proved short-lived.\par     Concerns over the U.S. trade deficit and the upcoming U.S.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 presidential election have weighed on the dollar since last  \f28 \par \par \uc2 week, boosting the regionals even as record oil prices weighed  \par \par \uc2 on their share markets.  \par \par \uc2 But, analysts said the Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  had lagged their  \par \par \uc2 major counterparts and some of the high-yielding \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,  \par \par \uc2 such as the Aussie and kiwi , in the latest dollar  \par \par \uc2 decline.  \par \par \uc2 "Obviously with the U.S. dollar index doing what it is  \par \par \uc2 doing it is not a surprise to see dollar/Asia lower," said  \par \par \uc2 David Simmonds, markets strategist with the Royal Bank of  \par \par \uc2 Scotland.  \par \par \uc2 "But Asian markets are not where the action is. You have  \par \par \uc2 Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  lagging the yen and the yen lagging other  \par \par \uc2 major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  such as the Swiss franc and kiwi on the  \par \par \uc2 crosses.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     "Therefore, the Asian regionals are not really prominent in\par this weak dollar move," Simmonds said.\par     The Taiwan dollar          was among Asia's top performers\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 on Tuesday, catching up with the region after a typhoon forced  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 markets to close on Monday. It hit 33.60 per dollar, the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 highest since June, shrugging off a weak stock market .  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The Taiwan stock exchange has been in decline for the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 better part of the last three weeks and risk aversion seems to  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 be going higher - these factors will limit the upside in the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Taiwan dollar," Bhanu Baweja of UBS said in a note to clients.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In South Korea, a Bank of Korea (BOK) official said a  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 stronger won would help ease inflationary pressures in the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 economy, but the won was following the yen and its recent rise  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 did not indicate a change in policy.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The BoK has suggested a stronger \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as a possible  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 route to control inflationary expectations before, but it is  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the MoFE (\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ministry of Finance\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and Economics) that eventually  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 owns \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policy in Korea, and they don't seem to be in a hurry  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 to let the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  move higher," Baweja said.  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  Change on the day at   0820 GMT\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       106.81         106.51       -0.28\par  Sing dlr        1.6642         1.6619       -0.14\par  Taiwan dlr      33.693         33.796       +0.31\par  Korean won     1133.40        1134.80       +0.12\par  Baht             41.02          41.02       +0.00\par  Peso             56.34          56.30       -0.07\par  Rupiah         9061.00        9069.00       +0.09\par  Rupee            45.68          45.64       -0.09\par  Change on year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid  End prev year    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       106.81         107.31       +0.47\par  Sing dlr        1.6642         1.6978       +2.02\par  Taiwan dlr      33.693         33.978       +0.85\par  Korean won     1133.40        1192.00       +5.17\par  Baht             41.02          39.59       -3.50\par  Peso             56.34          55.49       -1.51\par  Rupiah         9061.00        8410.00       -7.18\par  Rupee            45.68          45.60       -0.18.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041026e0aq005k3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
