\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Rupiah weak,  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  helps rest.  \b0\par\par\uc2 605 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Juli 2004\par 10:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , July 29 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah fell\par on Thursday while other Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  won some breathing\par space against the U.S. dollar on the suspicion that Asian\par central banks were \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to support their \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar        spent the day in a narrow band\par around 1.7250 per dollar, recovering from near 1.73 in offshore\par deals, its lowest since mid-May.\par     The Taiwan dollar          hit a fresh eight-month low of\par 34.27 at the open before suspected heavy dollar-selling\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  forced it up. It hit 33.96 in\par stray deals before eventually settling at 34.16/18.\par  \par     The Thai baht        briefly fell to 41.50, a new low since\par August 2003, before paring losses.\par     Analysts at Barclays Capital said data on Thursday showing\par unexpected drops in industrial output in South Korea and Japan\par in June would be another factor weighing against the regionals.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     However, as the trend in industrial data in these two\par economies was still strong, dollar/yen would eventually move\par lower from current six-week highs near 112 a dollar, they said.\par     The Korean won                   fell as far as 1,170 per\par dollar in offshore deals, but settled a shade higher.\par     UBS strategist Bhanu Baweja said he would sell the won and\par buy the Sing dollar, betting that Singapore's relative economic\par strength would boost its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     "Fundamentally it is a trade based on the relative\par positions of Singapore and South Korea in their respective\par economic cycles," Baweja said in a note to clients.\par     "It also stacks up well from a \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policy\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 perspective. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore are on a  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 tightening monetary policy bias which they execute through the  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets by selling U.S. dollars while the Bank of  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Korea has been buying U.S. dollars to keep the won competitive  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 while their domestic economy remains so weak."  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 RUPIAH FALLS, PESO RATING CUT  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The rupiah caught up with the regional downtrend on  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Thursday after the previous day's lull. It slipped over half a  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 percent to 9,170 a dollar.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Indonesian finance ministry announced it was raising  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 its forecast for the dollar/rupiah rate for 2004 to 8,900 from  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the 8,600 forecast in the budget.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Elsewhere, ratings agency Standard & Poor's lowered the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Philippines' long-term local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  sovereign rating by a  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 notch to BBB-minus, the lowest investment grade.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The peso        barely moved, straddling 56 per dollar most\par of the day and ending slightly weaker.\par     Sameer Goel, a strategist with Bank of America, said the\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 rating change could affect sentiment but not too many  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 foreigners had an exposure to peso debt.  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  Change on the day at   0820 GMT\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       111.71         111.33       -0.34\par  Sing dlr        1.7245         1.7238       -0.04\par  Taiwan dlr      34.185         34.199       +0.04\par  Korean won     1168.20        1167.20       -0.09\par  Baht             41.38          41.42       +0.10\par  Peso             56.02          55.99       -0.05\par  Rupiah         9164.00        9110.00       -0.59\par  Rupee            46.46          46.30       -0.34\par  Change on year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid  End prev year    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       111.71         107.31       -3.94\par  Sing dlr        1.7245         1.6978       -1.55\par  Taiwan dlr      34.185         33.978       -0.61\par  Korean won     1168.20        1192.00       +2.04\par  Baht             41.38          39.59       -4.34\par  Peso             56.02          55.49       -0.95\par  Rupiah         9164.00        8410.00       -8.23\par  Rupee            46.46          45.60       -1.86.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040729e07t0017j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
