\par\par \b \uc2 Singapore rates leap and sink, baffling markets.   \b0\par\par\uc2 By Vidya Ranganathan   \par \uc2 503 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Juli 2004\par 08:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  (Fixes headline)    \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, July 15 (Reuters) - Singapore's money market rates more than quadrupled in the first 12 days of July before softening swiftly this week, leaving dealers clueless about where the cash went and whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was behind the move.    \par \par \uc2  Overnight rates  rose from 0.39 percent at the end of June to 1.65 percent on Monday, and then dropped to 0.97 percent on Thursday.    \par \par \uc2  Other rates on the short-term curve were slightly less volatile but also rose and fell in quick succession.    \par \par \uc2  When rates started rising, many traders speculated the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MAS) was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to push rates higher and thereby force the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar  up.    \par \par \uc2  Nizam Idris, an analyst with IDEAglobal.com, said recent evidence of strength in the economy had fed speculation of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the MAS.    \par \par \uc2  "You can't discount that possibility altogether," he said.    \par \par \uc2  "Although I don't suppose it is MAS style to induce volatility," he said.    \par \par \uc2  MAS officials said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not comment on its money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 .    \par \par \uc2  The MAS runs its monetary policy by guiding the Singapore dollar within an undisclosed trade-weighted band of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the city-state's trading partners.    \par \par \uc2  On April 12, the MAS said it was tightening policy through the exchange rate to pre-empt any inflationary pressures.    \par \par \uc2  But the Singapore dollar weakened in nominal and trade-weighted terms until early July. It was quoted around 1.7040/50 per dollar on Thursday, below its four-year high of 1.6605 hit on April 13.    \par \par \uc2  Analysts reckoned it was about time the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose so that policy can tighten. Recent data, showing GDP expanding strongly, inflation at a three-year high and industry growing robustly, vindicated the MAS's decision in April to tighten, they said.    \par \par \uc2  FED RESPONSIBLE?    \par \par \uc2  Several traders said speculation surrounding the U.S. Federal Reserve's decision to raise rates for the first time in four years was the reason behind the spike in Singapore rates.    \par \par \uc2  In the weeks before the June 30 decision by the Fed to raise rates by 25 basis points from a 46-year low of 1.0 percent, traders cited heavy purchases of U.S. dollars versus Sing dollars through the spot market and forwards, betting that a rate rise would boost the greenback.    \par \par \uc2  "Those positions were being funded on a daily basis, and that put pressure on overnight rates," said a trader.    \par \par \uc2  And there were many in the market who showed no surprise at what they termed a "July phenomenon". Rates shot up inexplicably in July 2003 too, and have done sporadically in the past.    \par \par \uc2  Bhanu Baweja, a UBS \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist, said Singapore dollar forwards and money market rates were likely to remain tight for some more time.    \par \par \uc2  "It is a small, open economy where monetary policy targets the exchange rate. Money supply in Singapore is going to be endogenous and interest rates are going to be decided abroad," he said.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040715e07f000kp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
